{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994118579662001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"sage-rant-hinge","assignee":null,"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":1},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783056798195481001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# BUG: config-file mcp.readonly not honored by the LLM runner's comment tool\n\n## What\n`runner.py:566-571` `_readonly_gate` reads only env `REBAR_MCP_READONLY`; `mcp_server.py:208-223` is config-aware. A server made read-only via `[mcp] readonly=true` (env unset) hides MCP write tools but a `source=local` gate run still grants the review agent `comment_ticket` (`runner.py:219`, `pai_tools.py`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Both surfaces resolve read-only through one config-aware helper (env wins over file, fail-closed).\n- [ ] Regression test: file-only readonly => the review agent's comment tool is withheld.\n- [ ] Commit carries a `rebar-ticket:` trailer.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","9322-f84a-e047-4471"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9322-f84a-e047-4471","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9d7a-d09d-835f-484c","ticket_type":"bug","title":"BUG: config-file mcp.readonly not honored by the LLM runner's comment tool","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["584fc065-ddd6-4f07-9bff-fdebe30068a7"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994118579662001,"uuid":"96d30bb6-9c6e-4646-a053-6ab20159b361"}